@using Hoaii.Web.Services
@inject PageContentService Page
@* Câu chuyện trong từng sản phẩm — see design-specs/home/04-blog-and-story.md

   Figma node 1214:38902 is 1920×1080 with a 184×103 media frame (node 1530:39223) centred
   over the heading. The video file and the "grow to fill the section on hover" behaviour were
   given by the client — the MCP connection returns no Prototype/Reactions for this file, so
   none of the motion below is read from Figma. *@
<section class="story-banner" data-story-banner>
    @* The old static accent image is gone: the video now occupies that slot, and being the
       larger of the two it used to show around the video's edges. *@

    @* The section is the hover target rather than the heading alone: once the video grows it
       covers the heading, and a heading-only trigger would flip-flop under the cursor.
       tabindex makes the reveal reachable by keyboard — focusin/out in home.js and the
       :focus-within rule in home.css give it the same play+grow as hover. *@
    <video class="story-banner__video"
           src="/videos/home-story.mp4"
           poster="/images/home/home-story-poster.jpg"
           muted loop playsinline preload="none" tabindex="0"
           aria-label="Xem video câu chuyện trong từng sản phẩm"></video>

    <h2 class="story-banner__title">
        <span class="story-banner__title--desktop">@Page.Get(PageContentKeys.Home, "story_banner_desktop")</span>
        <span class="story-banner__title--mobile">
            <span>@Page.Get(PageContentKeys.Home, "story_banner_mobile_1")</span>
            <span>@Page.Get(PageContentKeys.Home, "story_banner_mobile_2")</span>
        </span>
    </h2>
</section>
